\label{proposition-vanishing-Noetherian}
\begin{reference}
\cite[Theorem 3.6.5]{Tohoku}.
\end{reference}
Let $X$ be a Noetherian topological space.
If $\dim(X) \leq d$, then $H^p(X, \mathcal{F}) = 0$
for all $p > d$ and any abelian sheaf $\mathcal{F}$
on $X$.

